      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cumberland_City%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The plant’s towering stacks are among Tennessee’s tallest structures and can be seen from up to 30 miles away.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cumberland_City%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "South of the fossil plant lies a Wells Creek impact crater, a rare geological feature in the area.",
