        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cumberland_City%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Cumberland City sits at 36°23′26″N 87°38′27″W, placing it in northern Tennessee near the Cumberland River.",
